claim.claim-text:
19. An system for transmitting and extracting a second signal encoded in a first video signal comprising: a transmission system comprising: a video signal source providing said first video signal at a first output terminal; a second signal source providing said second signal at a first output terminal; 

 a code generator providing a code at a first output; a code modulator having an output terminal and a first input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said second signal source and having a second input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said code generator; an adder having an output and a first input terminal in electrical communication with said first output terminal of said video signal source and a second input in electrical communication with said output terminal of said code modulator; and a transmitter having an input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said adder; a television receiver having a television screen; and a decoder comprising: a first photodiode; a second photodiode; a difference amplifier having a first input terminal in electrical communication with said first photodiode and a second input terminal in electrical communication with said second photodiode and having an output terminal; a code generator having an input terminal and an output terminal; a multiplier having a first input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said difference amplifier and a second input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said code generator and having an output terminal; an integrator having an input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said multiplier and having an output terminal; a code search synchronizer having a first input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said integrator, having an output terminal in electrical communication with said input terminal of said code generator, and having a second input terminal; and 

 a processor having a first input terminal in electrical communication with said output terminal of said integrator and having a first output terminal in electrical communication with said second input terminal of said code search synchronizer, wherein said first photodiode is configured to view said television screen and wherein at least one of said code generator and said code modulator utilizes a spread spectrum technique.
